  • Reconstruct the Stage 1 verification-rule closure and reclassify every entry
  • Validate immutable producer sources and rerun Stage 4 preflight/bijection checks
  • If proof mode, rebuild a fresh Lean project and audit theorem identity, axioms, and operational bridges
  • Write REVIEW.md and complete evidence index with the consistent verdict pair
