+  `d3a3a5f900992e805887806c558b10a13b9fb56d388836e69c00172fb1f74765`
+- Generation-time producer-source tree:
+  `363d98891cb09c42f1719e3632b09413274cb5603460fa8823003da0ffba11b0`
+- Resolved audit input:
